t(67, 655, """Some entity in the world is striving for that! Allah alone knows whether it will come about or not. But all the human indicators confirm that this is the likeliest. 2026 is, and Allah knows best, the bridge and the crossing .. your prayer beads .. your copy of the Qur'an .. your wheat .. your home, if you are in your own country or in a country far from the dangers, Allah willing .. your fishing rod .. fire-lighting tools .. a bag for carrying water .. and what is needed to move from city to city until you reach a place other than your own if .. if your place becomes unsafe.""")

t(67, 1930, """Three and a half years ago, in the early days of the channel, the first of those present here on the channel listened to that recording .. Commenting on the news of the Muslim Brotherhood being designated a terrorist entity: I spoke 3 and a half years ago about this movement, which in truth has been floundering in politics ever since its founding, since the era of its founder, so its floundering is nothing new .. And since its situation, long years ago, was that it had been finished off, I said that central events like these in the life of any movement in the world require its followers to reconsider .. And since I did not know any of its leaders and saw no benefit in addressing them through my channel, because I knew the reply would be: who is this nobody talking to us and addressing us, we do not even see him, so how would we listen to him .. Since the matter was thus clearly understood by me, I said a word is due to the followers of that movement among the ordinary people, who for years on end defended it desperately as though it were Islam itself and its fall meant the fall of Islam! So I addressed them that day and told them: since you have seen the end of your movement, which will never rise again until the Day of Resurrection, and I still repeat and say again that it will not rise until the Day of Resurrection, I said you must wake up, return to your senses and realise that, and join your Ummah, far from partisanship and from classifying, affiliation-based political thinking, and be like us, part of the people .. That day the amount of insults and abuse in the comments was unprecedented, some of it obscene and some short of obscene and close to obscene.

Today, as they reap a new siege and a new worldwide ganging-up against them .. I say to the simple, ordinary people who belong to that group .. Our brothers, you have neither she-camel nor camel in this .. Enough of these political affiliations; had there been any good in them they would have benefited the Ummah in the great strife. Since the killing of Uthman, may Allah be pleased with him, the Ummah has seen the bane of these political affiliations and what they do to the Ummah .. And you have seen your leaders either killed, imprisoned or pursued worldwide .. Enough of this affiliation""")

t(68, 60, """and of others like it, for by Allah religion is not preserved by such affiliations, nor does the Muslim's heart settle in worship, devotion and clarity of mind by joining these party and organisational affiliations .. Enough .. I say to you the same sentence I said 3 and a half years ago and have not repeated since that day: return to your Ummah, renounce every political, party and organisational affiliation, and be like the rest of the people, far from these orientations that bring no good to yourselves, your families or your Ummah.

Your movement, your organisation and every Islamic political organisation are, by Allah, heading for complete collapse, and they will not rise again until the Day of Resurrection""")

