t(70, 120, """A question reached me about the words of Allah Almighty concerning the disbelievers:

{Do they feel secure that an overwhelming punishment from Allah will not come upon them, or that the Hour will not come upon them suddenly while they are unaware?}

The question that reached me: is the verse addressed to the disbelievers alone, or are the Muslims addressed by the same noble verse?

The answer: the verse addresses one class of people, and they are the disbelievers, because the Hour does not come upon a Muslim, as is established. So the verse addresses the same class of addressee from its beginning to its end.""")

